\"end\": 571, \"text\": \"With the demise of DC Focus, this run was published under the unfocused DC bullet.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d00\", \"start\": 572, \"end\": 620, \"text\": \"DC announced \\\"Hard Time\\\"'s cancellation in March\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 95, \"text\": \"an adult and given fifty years to life in prison with eligibility for parole in the year 2053 .\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d01\", \"start\": 96, \"end\": 170, \"text\": \"Ethan maintains that the media convicted him before he ever got to trial .\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d01\", \"start\": 171, \"end\": 379, \"text\": \"Season one [ edit ] While in prison , Ethan continues to manifest a superpower called the `` KHE-CHARE '' that appears as psychic manifestation of his alter ego while he sleeps , or is otherwise unconscious .\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d01\", \"start\": 380, \"end\": 493, \"text\": \"A fellow inmate , the elderly `` Fruitcake '' eventually instructs Ethan on the use of his power and its origin .\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0042-8242d479974c:d01\", \"start\": 494, \"end\": 529, \"text\": \"Initially , Ethan is unaware of his\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"comic book series\", \"superhero\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"comic book series\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"superhero\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"super-powered character story\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
